      "id": "claim_64f7140b4318441f94aaf692b99b750f",
      "statement": "The web app is the primary interactive client: `apps/web/src/main.tsx` bootstraps TanStack Router and React Query under shared theme and font providers, while `apps/web/src/routes/__root.tsx` adds the global UI shell, checkout incentive provider, toast system, and development-only devtools for all routes.",
