      "statement": "The mobile app is an Expo client shell in the shared workspace: its package entrypoint is `expo-router/entry`, it exposes Expo start/run scripts, and it depends on the shared `@shopwise/env` package, but the main web-backend-AI request flows documented here are wired through other inspected paths.",
