    {
      "id": "claim_fb4e82fe0fb44c4788962c43ad1b209f",
      "statement": "The Go backend is a stateful modular monolith whose main entrypoint delegates to `bootstrap.Run()`, while `bootstrap.Run()` loads config, connects Postgres and Redis, creates a Redis-backed job client, wires repositories and services, registers HTTP routes, starts the server, and gracefully shuts down on process signals.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://services/main-backend/cmd/retail/main.go#L1-L39",
