      "statement": "The web app talks directly to backend session APIs and always supplies either bearer auth or an `X-Anonymous-ID`; the resume route uses a token-based backend call, clears the token from the URL after success, invalidates cached session queries, and redirects into the dashboard with the resumed session ID.",
