      "statement": "Operationally, the backend will not fully start without configuration, Postgres, Redis, and the job client, its health handler reports database and Redis status separately and returns `503 degraded` when either dependency is unhealthy, and shutdown closes the HTTP server, database, Redis client, and job client.",
