      "id": "claim_1b4a7031011b4c45916ec212e8d069e6",
      "statement": "The AI runtime prefers structured failures over unchecked model output: OpenAI calls are retried with exponential backoff for transient API failures, catalog HTTP problems surface as `502`, invalid model outputs trigger self-correction retries, and unexpected exceptions become structured FastAPI or SSE error responses.",
